# Layer Boundaries

```
src/app/          Screens only — compose organisms, call hooks
src/components/   atoms → molecules → organisms (never upward)
src/hooks/        Wire store + engine + gestures; no JSX
src/store/        Zustand; calls engine; no hooks/components
src/engine/       Pure TS; no React/async/store/hooks
src/types/        Types only; no runtime code
src/constants/    Values only; may import types for annotations
src/utils/        Stateless helpers
src/styles/       Design tokens
```

## Import direction (no upward arrows)

`constants → types → engine → store → hooks → components → app`

- Atoms/molecules: props only, no store
- Organisms: may call hooks; never call engine directly
- Always `@/` aliases across top-level folders
- Barrels (`index.ts`) re-export only — no logic
